Description:
- A file watcher that listens on the Linux kernel filesystem events through the inotify API.

Usage:
- make && ./fwatcher [...directory]

Supported Events:
- file/dir          onCreate
- file/dir          onTouch/onModify
- file/dir          onDelete
- file/dir          onRename
- file/dir          onMove from/to watched directory
- watched directory onDeleteSelf

NOTE:
- the file watcher is not recursive, if the watched directory
   have nested directories you to add them manually
